      "title": "Customer Service Representatives",
      "rationale": "These workers are the primary users, or \"agents,\" who use the software to manage customer communications across email, live chat, phone, and social media from a single inbox to track and resolve support requests ([D:LiveAgent:landing:1], [D:LiveAgent:landing:2])."
    },
    {
      "code": "15-1232.00",
      "title": "Computer User Support Specialists",
      "rationale": "As these specialists provide technical help, they would use LiveAgent's help desk features to automatically turn user messages into tickets and track and resolve every request ([D:LiveAgent:landing:2])."
    },
    {
      "code": "43-1011.00",
      "title": "First-Line Supervisors of Office and Administrative Support Workers",
      "rationale": "These supervisors would oversee teams of customer service agents, using LiveAgent's features to handle calls, track conversations, and manage agent performance, with pricing structured on a per-agent basis ([D:LiveAgent:landing:4], [D:LiveAgent:landing:7])."
    }
  ]
